sequenceDiagram
  participant E as ESP32
  participant P as FarmPi
  participant D as MariaDB
  E->>P: HTTPS payload(device_time, clock_valid, sample_seq)
  P->>P: receive UTC; validate fields/drift
  P->>D: insert or deduplicate(sensor, sample_seq)
  P-->>E: accepted, observed_at, received_at, server_time, time_sync_required
  alt invalid or drift > 30s
    E->>E: set FarmPi UTC before next round
  end
